hi everyone  i'm here to talk to you today about  procurement document ai  does your business have a lot of  receipts and invoices that you have to  do manual work for  do you hate having to type in every  expense for your expense reports  automate it with google's procurement  document ai  so what is procurement document ai and  what's the ai part of it  this is a solution that allows you to  turn unstructured content  into structured data procurement.ai has  a tooling for the procurement lifecycle  so whether you have handwritten receipts  you need digitized  utility statements invoices with coffee  stains purchase orders  credit and debit statements this stock  ai has got you covered  how is this smart why wouldn't i just  use ocr  well this solution has specialized  parsers for specific document types as  mentioned before  this service cleans your images and uses  google vision ocr to extract the text  then  understands the structure of the  document sections like  forms tables barcodes next  the word text and visual elements are  used for classification when required  google uses an ensemble of natural  language models to extract entities  so here it understands your line items  and all the information  related to it when entities are related  they are grouped together here  for example let's look at this line item  we're able to detect the related fields  such as  unit price and quantity they're all  grouped together in their response  what can you do with it once your data  is structured you can easily integrate  into your own app or database  or use one of ours such as bigquery or  firestore  then for everyone doing analytics out  there you can visualize it with tools  such as looker or data studio  i actually decided to use some code to  inspect my invoices in a google sheet  i started by uploading my files into  google cloud storage  then wrote a script to extract a few of  the entity types i cared about  and output them into my tracker  i can also inspect individual documents  with my processor  in the document ai platform  what was really helpful for me is that  it normalized the amounts and dates  so it's much easier to work with  programmatically  now that i have my data extracted i can  make charts to summarize my expenses  or automate them into a report so why  should i use it  you can increase operational efficiency  by reducing manual data entry  improve customer experience and informed  decision making  now you can bring the power of google ai  to your business's  procurement life cycle i hope we enticed  you to check out this new part of the  cloud document ai family  you can get started today with  procurement document ai  and the cloud console let us know what  you plan to build  happy processing  you

